OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fsunshine this evening, then clear
OL,7,Fperiods at first overnight. Some rain
OL,8,Farriving later in the night, this most
OL,9,Flikely in Devon and Cornwall, but some
OL,10,Flocations in the east perhaps staying
OL,11,Fdry. Turning misty over higher ground.
OL,12,FMild.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FA cloudy start to the day
OL,15,Fwith showery rain in places, this
OL,16,Fclearing by lunchtime. Drier and
OL,17,Fbrighter during the afternoon, with
OL,18,Fplenty of sunshine. Breezier but still
OL,19,Fwarm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
