OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells and showers, these heaviest and
OL,7,Fmost numerous on Thursday. Hail and
OL,8,Fthunder possible. Highly variable
OL,9,Frainfall amounts with some places
OL,10,Fstaying much drier. Occasionally
OL,11,Fbreezy and feeling fresher.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
